<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Dec 27.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Dec 27.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Friday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali recommends a price freeze during the fasting month of Ramadan which starts by January 10.</p>
<p>- President discusses with Tourism Minister Slaheddine Maaoui plans for developing the Tabarka resort in northwestern Tunisia.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Parliament adopted the higher education and health ministries' budgets for 1997.</p>
</text>
